  "Software Details": "软件详情",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "eCommerceGo SaaS 中的营销模块旨在彻底改变您推广业务的方式。",
  "View Live Demo": "查看现场演示",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "通过营销模块扩大您的业务范围",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "通过我们强大的营销模块提高您的销售额，该模块旨在简化营销活动、跟踪绩效并轻松推动增长",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "轻松创建和编辑您的业务资料",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "开始新业务或管理多个品牌？",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "从各种商业主题中进行选择",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "营销模块还提供一系列可定制的业务主题，以增强您的品牌展示。",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "通过可定制的营销活动推动增长",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "直接从平台发起动态营销活动，将您的业务提升到一个新的水平。",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "使用一体化工具简化您的营销工作",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "借助营销模块，管理企业的营销工作从未如此简单。",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "为什么选择专用模块",
  "for your business?": "为了您的生意？",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "借助 EcommerceGo，您可以从一个位置方便地管理所有业务功能",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "通过 EcommerceGo 为您的员工提供支持",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "通过高级附加组件访问产品查询、产品评论、产品快速查看等，全部集中在一处！",
